# ProjectCharter DSL v0.1 — subconjunto operacional do Charter.
# ORIGEM: ahhvahh/doc-arquitetura, develop@bde79df99bff1a1f6f7fb12bfcfb5cb81c598585
# ATENCAO: nao substitui a norma Markdown nem o julgamento humano.
PCDSL 1
BASE docs/ProjectCharter/1.0/charter
POL target=explicit_github_url
POL branch=develop
POL reference=ahhvahh/doc-arquitetura@main:read_only
POL write=explicit_diff_approval+head_sha+develop_only
POL unknown=ask_user+block_dependent_action
POL no_inference=true
POL source_of_truth=normative_markdown
ROUTE entrada|project-intake-review.md
ROUTE existente|existing-project-catalog.md
ROUTE migracao|legacy-charter-migration.md
ROUTE refinamento|charter-refinement.md
ROUTE fechamento|charter-review.md
ROUTE objetivos|objective-refinement.md
ROUTE exclusoes|non-objective-refinement.md
ROUTE condicoes|constraint-assumption-refinement.md
ROUTE questoes|open-question-resolution.md
ROUTE descoberta|discovery-refinement.md
CHECK CH-001|BLOCKER|exists|README.md|README com proposito do Charter
CHECK CH-002|BLOCKER|min_docs|objectives/OBJ-*.md:1|Ao menos um objetivo verificavel
CHECK CH-003|BLOCKER|min_docs|project-context/PCH-*.md:1|Contexto de projeto e atores
CHECK CH-004|BLOCKER|statuses|.|Documentos canonicos devem estar refined ou implemented
CHECK CH-005|BLOCKER|no_pending|README.md|Proposito nao pode conter PENDING
CHECK CH-006|BLOCKER|links|.|Links internos devem apontar para arquivos existentes
CHECK CH-007|BLOCKER|badges|.|Documentos devem conter tipo/status/versao
CHECK CH-008|BLOCKER|unique_ids|.|IDs de arquivos canonicos nao podem colidir
CHECK CH-009|REVIEW|semantic|README.md|Validar problema, proposito, beneficiarios e valor
CHECK CH-010|REVIEW|semantic|objectives|Validar OBJ com motivacao, resultado e criterio verificavel
CHECK CH-011|REVIEW|semantic|non-objectives|Verificar NOBJ, efeitos e responsabilidades
CHECK CH-012|REVIEW|semantic|conditions|Confirmar CON/ASM e criterios de validade
CHECK CH-013|REVIEW|semantic|open-questions|Confirmar inexistencia de OPEN bloqueadora
CHECK CH-014|REVIEW|semantic|discovery|Confirmar DSC com fonte oficial, versoes e conclusao
CHECK CH-015|REVIEW|semantic|project-context|Confirmar stakeholders e ACT canonicos